ign and decorative arts.","evidence_claim":"RISD states that its museum houses about 100,000 works and offers exhibitions, lectures, tours, workshops and resources for students and researchers.","source_url":"https://www.risd.edu/academics/campus-resources/risd-museum","source_title":"RISD Museum","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"RISD says faculty, staff and students are admitted free with ID; follow museum visitor policies for in-gallery study.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["The Study Pavilion source is a third-party hosted copy of Fleet Library architectural documentation; all other cards use RISD-operated sources."]}],"warnings":[]}
